--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Scope of this license
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Apache-2.0 license above covers the PAAF *framework* — the five Python
packages under `packages/` (paaf-core, paaf-llm, paaf-voice, paaf-session,
paaf-trace).

The two applications (the embedded assistant process and the Electron
desktop control panel) are not yet built. Their license defaults to
Apache-2.0 for v1; whether the apps adopt AGPL for capture-resistance is
recorded as an OPEN governance question in `DECISIONS.md` (it is NOT yet
chosen). See `DECISIONS.md` → "App license — OPEN governance question".

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

PAAF consumes third-party open-source models and libraries at runtime
(e.g. Chatterbox, Whisper via faster-whisper, LangChain/LangGraph, Silero
VAD, Ollama). Each is distributed under its own license by its respective
authors; PAAF does not relicense them. Their attribution travels with the
dependency artifacts resolved by `uv`, not with this NOTICE.
